    "detailed_description": "A short story about Marzia shipping cargo to some port,<br>she decides to take a short break after going FTL for a while.<br><br>This is a short visual novel I made as an attempt to make a game for steam.<br>This story is not based on reality, but more of what it is like to live a life in the future,<br>and what may happen in the future, as in this character Marzia has to live the struggles of<br>trying to pay her bills while not getting killed by atleast anything.<br><br>I tried my best to make this game as artistically pleasing and good enough<br>to understand the story, I hope you will enjoy it!<br><br><br><strong>Features[/i]</strong><br> &gt; The gameplay time may be a little short (5-15 minutes)<br> &gt; A story with at least 3 endings<br> &gt; And nothing else...",
